使用（商用利用）\n・SNS等での広報活動（ポスターなど）での使用\n\nお忙しいなか恐れ入りますが、ご検討よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@B_Saigennaku/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3623316, "client_id": 2934223, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/487b865d/uploads/origins/00708cc3-499f-4974-b9f9-067c441270d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=208b0ec5997c65738ba199ba96205f2e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/487b865d/uploads/origins/00708cc3-499f-4974-b9f9-067c441270d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=208b0ec5997c65738ba199ba96205f2e, https://si.imgix.net/487b865d/uploads/origins/00708cc3-499f-4974-b9f9-067c441270d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea0f5bf4a11a4296c15e01aa5d57917a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/487b865d/uploads/origins/00708cc3-499f-4974-b9f9-067c441270d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e0f929f8a346539a80a1c49afb86d5d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/487b865d/uploads/origins/00708cc3-499f-4974-b9f9-067c441270d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c383a44f975db900836fe75d50c67d33", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/487b865d/uploads/origins/00708cc3-499f-4974-b9f9-067c441270d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c383a44f975db900836fe75d50c67d33, https://si.imgix.net/487b865d/uploads/origins/00708cc3-499f-4974-b9f9-067c441270d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d1273a8dedc7a0b607952e900bcc5a4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/487b865d/uploads/origins/00708cc3-499f-4974-b9f9-067c441270d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&f